From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 19:24:15 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Implement custom locale override support for backend and
 frontend

- Configure Rails to prioritise custom translation files in the load path
- Refactor the frontend locale loader to merge custom JSON assets
- Update Vite and Storybook to recognise and include custom translations
- Adjust the service worker to incorporate merged locale files
- Add RSpec and Vitest suites to validate the override behaviour

Rationale: Users require a robust method to customise language strings without modifying core files, ensuring that local overrides persist across updates and remain maintainable.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

